<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that Equity Inns Inc, Gaylord Entertainment Co, BT Office Products International Inc, and Sport Supply Group Inc were unavailable for after-hours trade for news.  </p>
<p>The NYSE said that Corimon SACA, Fruehauf Trailer Corp and HealthPlan were also not available for trade after hours.</p>
</text>
